WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't think people
fully appreciate

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
how many jokes you generate...
-Yes.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.504
...to then have the jokes you do
for the Globes.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have some
that you chose not to do

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you're gonna --
you would like to read now.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:11.044
-Yes, I mean, only because
there's so little time to --

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.612
and you've got to choose wisely
and...

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:13.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah,
you don't get a lot of time.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But there were a lot of jokes
we really loved

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.316 line:92%
that we didn't get to cover.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I thought, if it was okay
with everyone here,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
we might -- I would
just bang through a bunch

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:20.754 line:92%
that we didn't get to do.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:22.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, all right, great.
-Okay.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:25.458 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.027 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
All right.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.295 line:92%
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:33.700
So -- So, just imagine that
I'm onstage at the Globes.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.367 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:38.571
Around 1,300 people attended
the Golden Globes this year...

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.040 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and only one will leave.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.842 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.977 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-Yeah.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Crazy Rich Asians"
is up for two awards,

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.382 line:92%
and "Crazy Rich White People"

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.217 line:92%
are up for the remaining 200.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.919 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.854 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:57.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
Should have done it.
-Yeah.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.126
-The International Ballroom
where the Golden Globes are held

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
are divided into three tiers
of seating --

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.131 line:92%
libtards, snowflakes, and cucks.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.467 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.336 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
We wanted Sandra
to say that one.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:13.807 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
Would have been so dope.
All right.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:19.112
"Roma" was nominated for best
director and best foreign film.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.113 line:92%
Guys, do yourself a favor --

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:24.150
go out and watch this one on
the biggest phone you can find.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.086 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.654 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's on Netflix.

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:31.024
"Roma" is such an emotional
experience, when it was over,

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.893
I literally sat there and cried
for a full five seconds

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.995
