plays Santa Claus.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:40.934 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I got it. I dig that.
-Yeah.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.738 line:92%
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.273 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"Green Book" nominated,

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is, of course,
a poignant biopic

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
about Dr. Seuss struggling
to finish the title

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.113 size:88% position:44% line:92%
