00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:53.646 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was originally just called
"Green Book."

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:56.349 line:92%
-Yeah, it was just "Green Book,"

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:58.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was like,
"How do I crack this?"

00:01:58.251 --> 00:01:59.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:02.188
"BlacKkKlansman" was nominated,
and judging by

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.257
the upper- and lower-case
lettering in the title,

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.259 line:92%
it is also a Wi-Fi password.

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.827 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:11.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's a John Mulaney joke.
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.298 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-He wrote it!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:15.902 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:18.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As you do.
-As one does.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:21.674 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Love him.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.276 line:92%
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.978 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
The best.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
Spike Lee's third time
being nominated for a Globe,

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.348 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
