00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:32.285
it's disappointing to see so few
Knicks here supporting him.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.319 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's my favorite one.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:38.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He goes to a lot
of Knicks games.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Whoo!

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-By the way, you would have
done that in L.A.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is actually in New York,
and that [bleep] tanked.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I'm so glad we didn't do it.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.001 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.836 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-To the time machine!

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:52.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:53.606 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-All right.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.743 line:92%
-"The Good Place" is nominated.

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:58.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a philosophical
afterlife comedy

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
