can Ted Danson still get it?

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.884 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:07.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not that complicated --
the answer is yes.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:09.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
Julia Roberts' Amazon show
"Homecoming"

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.394 line:92%
