00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.702 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughter continues ]

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.937 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoo!

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:27.073
-Again, we had very little time.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Americans"
