00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:07.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
They make...
-They talk --

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.881
-They are often making a brisket
on the show.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:09.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
