00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.120
They take time with the brisket
on that show...

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They do.
-...and it hits close to home.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Their prop master
makes that good brisket.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:19.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:21.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
There's more.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:23.730 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoo!

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Chuckling ]
There are so many more.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:26.566 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.102
The -- The writers
did a bang-up job, is my point.

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:30.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They did a bang-up job, yeah.
-All right.

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.804 line:92%
Netflix beat out Amazon tonight

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.873 size:78% position:39%
