himself in "A Star is Born."

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:41.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Seth wrote that one.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did I?
-Yeah.

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:43.316 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:47.287
Sent it to me, like five minutes
before the show.

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:49.522 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I was like, "What?!"

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:52.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
If Beale Street could talk,
I think it would say,

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.494 line:92%
"Ouch, stop driving on me!"

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:55.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seriously,
we agreed to host this

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:57.497 line:92%
super last minute, you guys.

00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:01.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
That was the full joke.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, and this one
was a back-and-forth

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
with me and Sandra.
-Okay, yeah.

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:04.937 line:92%
So, will you read her parts?

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:05.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Okay.

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The all-female franchise
reboot trend

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
