with the movie "Ocean's 8,"

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:11.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there are
many more on the way.

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:13.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, you know
what they should do --

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.849
a female reboot of "Magic Mike,"
but with all ladies.

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:19.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, now,
that I would watch.

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:20.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
-Jesus Christ!

00:05:20.453 --> 00:05:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey! The line starts
right here, Seth!

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you. This has been
my audition for "Green Book."

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:27.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that was really good.
-Yeah, thank you.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was really good.
That was --

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:31.130 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Those were excellent.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's one more.
-Great.

00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:35.335 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:37.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Don't cut any of these
when you air this episode.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, here's how you'll know
if we cut any.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:43.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one on the card says
number 18.

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:47.146 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:47.146 --> 00:05:50.016 line:92%
So, if there are less than 18,

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:55.054
that means there were ones worse
than the worst one you saw.

00:05:55.054 --> 00:05:57.023 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.023 --> 00:06:01.361 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.428 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:04.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please cut it down
to one joke now.

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:06.165 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, right.

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:07.400 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-All right, last one --

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
There were some
amazing performances

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
