smushed them together and made

00:06:20.246 --> 00:06:23.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Boy Beautiful Ben
Is Erased Back Boy."

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:25.451 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Bravo!
-There you are. Yes.

00:06:26.586 --> 00:06:28.554
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's the way we do it.

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:30.656 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Of course.

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:32.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This was -- Right?

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:34.460 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Thanks to our writers.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.796 size:81% position:41%
-They did a great job.
-They did a great job.

00:06:36.796 --> 00:06:37.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sandra did a great job,
as well.

00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:38.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And it was really cool

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:40.466 size:81% position:41%
because you and Sandra
were great together,

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you really only knew
each other

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:42.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
from presenting together
at the Emmys, right?

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:46.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. No prior relationship
other than that one time.

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:48.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was so much fun
to watch you guys together.

00:06:48.207 --> 00:06:48.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was very...
-Thanks.

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:51.878
-...very fortunate that you guys
found each other at the Emmys,

00:06:51.878 --> 00:06:53.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they were lucky
to have you.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:54.046 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, that's nice.

00:06:54.046 --> 00:06:55.848 size:81% position:41%
-I have one last thing
to talk to you about,

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:56.749 size:78% position:39% line:92%
which I'm thrilled --

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:58.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Brooklyn Nine-Nine"
is coming back,

